"from the Ensembl REST AP..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_regulation_tools.rst 5b68d69cacf6469eb408469ef14683a8
msgid "EnsemblReg_get_motif_features tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_regulation_tools.rst:98 e304532c9bcb42279f24b77696109c52
msgid "**Name**: ``EnsemblReg_get_motif_features``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_regulation_tools.rst:100
#: 37136af0663a4a1fa2387ee3063dfe02
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get transcription factor (TF) binding motif features in "
"a genomic region from the Ensembl REST API. Returns motif instances with "
"their binding matrix IDs, TF complex names, scores, and genomic "
"positions. Use this to identify which transcription factors may bind to a"
" specific genomic region, essential for understanding gene regulation, "
"epigenomics, and cis-regulatory elements. Example: BRAF locus "
"(chr7:140424943-140524564) returns 50 TF binding motif instances "
"including PAX5, NR2F1, CEBPA."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_regulation_tools.rst:104
#: 05d2e029af3f4db7b65ca9a38ba1995d
msgid ""
"``species`` (string) (optional) Species name. Use 'homo\\_sapiens' for "
"human, 'mus\\_musculus' for mouse. Default: 'homo\\_sapiens'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_regulation_tools.rst:107
#: 7407567223ab4efda77f244fcb388fe2
msgid ""
"``region`` (string) (required) Genomic region in format 'chromosome"
":start-end'. Example: '7:140424943-140524564' for the BRAF locus, "
"'17:7661779-7687538' for the TP53 locus."
msgstr ""

